# MAUI Run Guidance (Windows)

1) Kill running instance to avoid file lock:
   ```
   taskkill /IM LmpLink.MAUI.exe /F
   ```

2) Build:
   ```
   cd C:\ai\projects\map-demo
   dotnet build src\LmpLink.MAUI\LmpLink.MAUI.csproj -f net10.0-windows10.0.19041.0
   ```

3) Run:
   ```
   cd C:\ai\projects\map-demo\src\LmpLink.MAUI\bin\Debug\net10.0-windows10.0.19041.0\win-x64
   .\LmpLink.MAUI.exe
   ```

Shortcut:
```
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".\scripts\maui-build-run.ps1"
```
